ent\n<MATH_0047>\n(the equality holds by the long exact cohomology sequence associated\nto the exact sequence above and the vanishing of higher ext groups\ninto the injective module <MATH_0048>). If\n<MATH_0049>, then we can choose a splitting\n<MATH_0050> and we can set\n<MATH_0051>\nso that we obtain the following diagram\n<MATH_0052>\nwith exact rows which shows that <MATH_0053>. Conversely, if\n<MATH_0054> exists, then the pushout of <MATH_0055> by the map\n<MATH_0056> is isomorphic to <MATH_0057> by\nLemma <REF_0005> and the vanishing of higher ext groups\ninto the injective module <MATH_0058>. This gives a diagram\nas above, which implies that <MATH_0059> is split as an extension, i.e.,\nthe class <MATH_0060> is zero.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1382b70999b707b9702c00343a5409951e7d78e877d3cc52892cdcffe52f6b6a", "unit_id": "tag:08L8:proof"}
